    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Removes the date from all of your posts and pages programatically in php. Just install the plugin, activate it and the date will not show on your posts and pages.</p>\n<p>There are no menus or extra code. This is the simplest way to remove the date from your posts and pages.</p>\n<p>Search engines and readers will not see the date.</p>\n",
